- `/tmp/p11sv-scratch/repro.rs`: REJECTED, `use of moved value: t`.
- `/tmp/p11sv-scratch/generated/0006_unsound_never_arbitrary_block_stmt_generic.rs`: REJECTED, `ghost expression of never type is not allowed in statement position`.
